.SH "Member Function Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "boolean animate (number seconds)"

.SS "number emit (uint count = \fR1\fP)"

.PP
Emit an immediate burst\&. Requires a layer and template for nonzero count\&. Works while continuous emission is stopped\&. Excess particles are dropped at the layer budget; count zero is a no-op\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIcount\fP Unsigned particle count; default 1\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
Number actually created\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
ParticleEffects 
.RE
.PP

.SS "number getEmissionRate ()"

.PP
Read the continuous rate\&. 
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
